  ## Description
  Adversary gathers victim cloud account inventory and telemetry context.
  
  ## Criticality
  **High** - A High priority incident is likely to result in a demonstrable impact to public health or safety, national security, economic security, foreign relations, civil liberties, or public confidence.
  
  ## Terrain
  Cloud identity and Azure account inventory telemetry.
  
  ## Surface
  > **Azure**
  > Microsoft Azure cloud platform
  
  ## Threat Assessment
  | Dimension | Assessment | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | Severity | High | - |
  | Impact | Credential Exposure | - |
  | Leverage | High | - |
  | Viability | Medium | - |
  | Kill Chain | Reconnaissance | Researching, identifying and selecting targets using active or passive reconnaissance. |
  
